00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:57.110
But I don't think she's the kind of judge
that will really do the kind of work that

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:58.390
I think needs to be done.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:01.360
Speaker 1: What on earth is he talking about?

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:05.540
He likes the fact that there's going to be
the first black woman on the court.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:08.550
He says that her qualifications are without
question.

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:13.170
But he's not big on her judicial philosophy,
