00:04:18.689 --> 00:04:20.129
But there's no substance there.

00:04:20.129 --> 00:04:24.960
It sounds like basically the only things he's
defending are reasons to vote for her confirmation

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:27.889
as
Speaker 2: the court, and I won't be supporting

