the importance of this moment.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:37.449
If it's a high point for the country, why
not support her, right?

00:04:37.449 --> 00:04:42.539
Well, I think the lifetime appointments have
a different criteria than other appointments.

00:04:42.539 --> 00:04:49.550
I've supported a significant number of President
Biden's nominees to the offices that will

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:54.419
end their time will end while he's still in
office or when he leaves office.

00:04:54.419 --> 00:04:59.099
I think that's a different criteria than somebody
putting somebody on the court for.

00:04:59.099 --> 00:05:02.259
Life, I don't think I've but
Speaker 1: you're still not really giving

00:05:02.259 --> 00:05:08.080
an example of what it is about her answers
that concerned you, so this is mealy mouthed,

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.699
to say the least.

00:05:09.699 --> 00:05:12.699
And quite frankly, it might be just as simple
as I'm not going to vote for her because my

00:05:12.699 --> 00:05:15.469
